<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάρθρ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>articulation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν μελέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; <i>differentiation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. λαμβάνειν,</span> of the embryo, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				583b23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				744b11
			</span></i>; of the Universe, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.38U.
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> esp.
				<i>movable articulation, diarthrosis</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνάρθρωσις</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.735
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18(1).433
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the voice,
				<i>articulate utterance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				535a31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν γραμμάτων δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					660a22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>distinct statement,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠθικῶν ἐννοιῶν,</span> title of work by
			Chrysipp., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				5.13
			</span></i>; <i>distinctness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Plot.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				3.14
			</span></i>.</div>
